  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Right now the --watch-avatars launch parameter feature does not check for new local avatars and only keeps an eye on local avatar files that existed upon game boot. It's been confirmed that it functions as intended.\n\nIt would be nice if it kept an eye on the entire local avatars folder and listed any newly added local avatars. Needing a restart to see a newly added local avatar can be a pain.",
